Subject: [PATCH] Eturlia: restore MinecraftServer.tickServer(BooleanSupplier)
 for Sable UDP

Folia only has the region 4-arg tickServer; Sable UDP mixin injects TAIL
of vanilla tickServer(BooleanSupplier). Add empty overload and call it
at the end of the Folia tick.

